              "main": {
                "contentmodel": "wikitext",
                "contentformat": "text/x-wiki",
                "*": "== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n{{Information\n|Description={{en|Ronald Reagan and Iraqi Foreign Minister Tariq Aziz meet at the White House on November 26, 1984, as the U.S. and Iraq restore diplomatic relations.}}\n{{it|[[:it:Ronald Reagan|Ronald Reagan]] (presidente degli [[:it:USA|USA]]) e [[:it:Tareq Aziz|Tareq Aziz]] (ministro degli esteri dell'[[:it:Iraq|Iraq]]) si incontrano alla [[:it:Casa Bianca|Casa Bianca]] il [[:it:26 novembre|26 novembre]] [[:it:1984|1984]], per il ristabilimento delle relazioni diplomatiche fra i due paesi.}}\n|Source=\nImmagine [[:it:National Security Agency|National Security Agency]], agenzia governativa USA; fonte\n\nhttp://www.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/nsa/publications/iraqgate/igpic.html\n([http://www.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/nsa/publications/iraqgate/igp1.gif link diretto])\n\n|Date=1984-11-26\n|Author= Photographer not credited\n|Permission=PD-USGOV.\n|other_versions=\n}}\n\n== {{int:license-header}} ==\n{{PD-USGov}}\n\n== Wikipedia upload log ==\nA Wikipedia description page is/was [http://it.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Image%3AIgp1.gif here]. All following user names refer to it.wikipedia.\n* 2007-01-16 02:04 [[:it:User:Hrundi V. Bakshi|Hrundi V. Bakshi]] 554×248× (91048 bytes) ''<nowiki>[[Ronald Reagan]] (presidente degli [[USA]]) e [[Tareq Aziz]] (ministro degli esteri dell'[[Iraq]]) si incontrano alla [[Casa Bianca]] il [[26 novembre]] [[1984]], per il ristabilimento delle relazioni diplomatiche fra i due paesi.  Immagine [[National Se</nowiki>''\n\n[[Category:Ronald Reagan at the White House in November 1984]]\n[[Category:Ronald Reagan in the Oval Office]]\n[[Category:Tariq Aziz]]\n[[Category:1984 in international relations of the United States]]\n[[Category:Relations of Iraq and the United States in the 1980s]]\n[[Category:Black and white photographs of people at the White House]]"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
